================================================================================
Model and provider notices
================================================================================

Atlas ships no model weights. Models are downloaded by the operator and remain
under their own licenses, which Atlas neither grants nor modifies. Several
carry use restrictions that are stricter than Atlas's own license -- notably
some are non-commercial. Read the license of any model you download.

Cloud providers reachable from Atlas (Anthropic, Google, OpenAI, Runway,
BytePlus, Higgsfield and others) are governed by each provider's own terms and
require your own credentials. Atlas transmits no data to any provider unless
you configure that provider and invoke it.
